%20251Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251Z\" >251Z</a><sup>*</sup>, 251HZ<sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251\" >251</a><sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251H\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251H\"  class=\"notoffered\">251H</a><sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20252Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 252Z\" >252Z</a><sup>*</sup>, 252HZ<sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20252\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 252\" >252</a><sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20252H\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 252H\"  class=\"notoffered\">252H</a><sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20254\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 254\" >254</a><sup>*</sup>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20254H\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 254H\" >254H</a><sup>*</sup> or minimum score of <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20060\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 060\"  class=\"notoffered\">060</a> in 'Math Placement - ALEKS'.<br/><sup>*</sup> May be taken concurrently.<br/>A minimum grade of C- is required in <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20111Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 111Z\" >MTH 111Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20111\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 111\" >MTH 111</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20112Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 112Z\" >MTH 112Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20112\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 112\" >MTH 112</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251Z\" >MTH 251Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251HZ\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251HZ\" >MTH 251HZ</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251\" >MTH 251</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=